{"id":"wb-7-1","name":"延庆古崖居","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"延庆古崖居","text":"延庆古崖居，位于中华人民共和国北京市延庆县张山营镇东门营村西北2.5公里处的洞沟的山坡上，是截至2016年中国境内发现的规模最大的崖居遗址。该古崖居发现于1984年，其开凿年代和居住人群至今没有准确定论。1991年，延庆古崖居正式对外开放，2013年被列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%BB%B6%E5%BA%86%E5%8F%A4%E5%B4%96%E5%B1%85","revisionId":92026384,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92026384","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/92545d87e7289352592b7ae9.jpg","title":"Guyaju_ruins,_Yanqing_county,_Beijing.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Guyaju_ruins,_Yanqing_county,_Beijing.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/06/Guyaju_ruins%2C_Yanqing_county%2C_Beijing.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"me (w:User:pfctdayelise)","license":"CC BY-SA 2.5","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.5","caption":"​古崖居， 北京","width":320,"height":240}}